citor to pass electrons without the electron coming into contact with another electron or surface friction from the component. Flux is the ability to distort the path of an electron so that it arrives at the other end at a controlled rate. Current resistors create a bottleneck to slow down electron flow. Bottlenecks create pressure, friction, and heat. Gemstone capacitors bend the path of an electron with a lense so that the electrons must follow a longer path to reach their destination. This elongated path also acts as a buffer to contain electrons on this elongated path. This type of resistor acts as a capacitor.  Time crystals:  If a crystal elongates the path of an electron. Time is literally dialated for an electron within this path. An electron could travel for 1 hour in a crystal and from the outside of the crystal we would see it only 1 second after pressing a switch.","topics":[],"score":211667,"global_rank":263061},{"name":"decodealex/back","owner":"decodealex","html_url":"https://github.com/decodealex/back","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211667,"global_rank":263062},{"name":"2qar/sdl-shooter","owner":"2qar","html_url":"https://github.com/2qar/sdl-shooter","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"A tiny arcade space shooter made in SDL","topics":[],"score":211667,"global_rank":263064},{"name":"srikxr/docs","owner":"srikxr","html_url":"https://github.com/srikxr/docs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"MDX","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211667,"global_rank":263084},{"name":"tcotav/gin-zerolog-demo","owner":"tcotav","html_url":"https://github.com/tcotav/gin-zerolog-demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":"Hack of golang gin + zerolog working together w/modules","topics":[],"score":211667,"global_rank":263085},{"name":"mmc102/scaper_server","owner":"mmc102","html_url":"https://github.com/m